msgstr "克隆源代码："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:43
#: 2ed20a044cb042dbb8960c207cc79ab6
msgid "Build"
msgstr "构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:45
#: eeb441eb0ccc44c3aec5405653eb5509
msgid "Build for Copter:"
msgstr "为 Copter 构建："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:52
#: a538b007f88e4c07914d03de07c3e1d0
msgid ""
"This will build the firmware for a quadcopter.  If you wish to build for "
"another frame type (such as hexacopter) append \"-hexa\" onto the end of the"
" make command (i.e. make erlebrain2-hexa -j4).  The full list of available "
"frames can be found in the `targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/targets.mk#L3>`__ "
"file."
msgstr ""
"这将为四旋翼构建固件。如果要为其他机架类型（如六旋翼）构建，请在 make 命令末尾附加「-hexa」（即 make erlebrain2-hexa "
"-j4）。可用机架的完整列表可在 `targets.mk "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/mk/targets.mk#L3>`__ "
"文件中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:61
#: f4c29d23444a4267b6389230aa0464d9
msgid ""
"If building for Plane, Rover or Antenna Tracker replace the above "
"\"ArduCopter\" with \"ArduPlane\", \"Rover\" or \"AntennaTracker\"."
msgstr ""
"如果为 Plane、Rover 或 Antenna Tracker "
"构建，请将上面的「ArduCopter」替换为「ArduPlane」、「Rover」或「AntennaTracker」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:65
#: 95045a0c0a044b76aeee7e330840dc3b
msgid "Move firmware to the executable directory"
msgstr "将固件移动到可执行目录"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:67
#: ee5f1ce99bad4c308bdfd8a977ae6d59
msgid ""
"When you compile Copter (in **~/ardupilot/ArduCopter**) the executable "
"**ArduCopter.elf** is created in the same folder. You need to move the "
"executable to home (\\`~/\\`or \\`/home/erle/\\`) because there is a service"
" in Erle-Brain 2 (called **apm.service**) which automatically launches the "
"autopilot from those locations."
msgstr ""
"在 **~/ardupilot/ArduCopter** 中编译 Copter 时，会在同一文件夹中生成可执行文件 "
"**ArduCopter.elf**。您需要将可执行文件移动到主目录（`~/` 或 `/home/erle/`），因为 Erle-Brain 2 "
"中有一个服务（称为 **apm.service**）会自动从这些位置启动飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:80
#: de02fda6a7d4405f9466cf9c661b0e96
msgid ""
"The service mentioned above, launches **ArduCopter** by default, using a "
"bridge for sending telemetry data and GPS placed in **ttyAMA0** by default"
msgstr "上述服务默认启动 **ArduCopter**，使用默认位于 **ttyAMA0** 的 GPS 数传桥接"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:84
#: b2a803e3c3a54d2480ad3061c9d4e3e7
msgid ""
"You can find additional information about the default launch process and "
"launch configuration options in the `documentation "
"<http://erlerobotics.com/docs/>`__."
msgstr "您可以在 `文档 <http://erlerobotics.com/docs/>`__ 中找到关于默认启动流程和启动配置选项的更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:90
#: b4555da04c44416b8c2966c80cedda4b
msgid ""
"If you are unable to copy the executable it may be because the destination "
"file is locked. This is because the autopilot is already running.  Use the "
"following command to stop the running service:"
msgstr "如果无法复制可执行文件，可能是因为目标文件被锁定——飞控已在运行。使用以下命令停止正在运行的服务："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:98
#: 10c4011853944822ba28c4359b85c9b4
msgid ""
"Now copy the executable in home (\\`~\\`or \\`/home/erle/\\`) and restart "
"the service in order to execute the new executable:"
msgstr "现在将可执行文件复制到主目录（`~` 或 `/home/erle/`）并重启服务以执行新的可执行文件："

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:105
#: c61c8787f115405995b920da3a2c8655
msgid "Or simply, restart the board once you have copied the new executable"
msgstr "或者，在复制新的可执行文件后直接重启开发板"
